# Deploy to Vercel

After changing this project, commit and push to `origin/main` before finishing. Vercel deploys from https://github.com/markbailey92/ncaaf-audio. Production is https://ncaaf-audio.vercel.app.

- Do not update git config.
- Use `/Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer/usr/bin/git` when `/usr/bin/git` is blocked by the Xcode license.
- If commit identity is unset, pass `-c user.name="markbailey92" -c user.email="48589304+markbailey92@users.noreply.github.com"` for that commit only.
- Do not commit secrets (`.env*`, credentials).
- After the push, confirm the Vercel production deployment is Ready.
